{"server":"cn","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_10_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_10","title":"再见，再见","storyCode":"BB-10","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"358e5ea7ae7c2f7e16809b4cbccf7353be0409e48e2e82df5a46aec62a998a64","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i21_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅拉着眼前之人的手，就像他们的第一次见面。\n她静静与那双眼睛对视，看到其中不停变换着情绪，最终，只留下空洞一片。\n她知道，最后的记忆已经抹去，灵魂已经纯净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的记忆已经死去，你的灵魂会重生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是可怕的伎俩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可那些人低估了你的善良，低估了你对胜利的渴望。那些人低估了我们，低估了泰拉坚忍至今的起源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，姑且再让我最后一次如此称呼你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是我对你小小的报复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是我对你......最后的馈赠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"记忆从不塑造你自己。以你最本来的面目......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......重新生活在......大地之上吧。去看看这个世界，去感受生活的喜怒哀乐，去结识形形色色的泰拉人民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许......你的旅程会从苦难中开始，总是离不开这片大地昏沉的月影，可你总能......见到太阳升起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后，我相信，你会重新得出一个答案。得出真正属于你的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那一定......和凯尔希，和我曾听到的那段呢喃一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"令人热泪盈眶吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"生命在流逝。\n她的耳边逐渐响起了来自远方的挽歌。对了，菈玛莲曾与她设下连接。\n特蕾西娅自己的气息在逐渐微弱......但她也感受到了前所未有的轻松。\n她尽力将阿米娅护在怀中，保护着。阿米娅的心跳令她安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我有点累了，捧住那顶冠冕真的很累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"累了就得休息，对吧，阿米娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我曾想过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许有天......我们会一起让这片大地上的每一个人，都能平静入梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然很遥远，但也许，你会替我看到那一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，当你醒来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你就要继续前行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——好累......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，她还没有来......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她只有最后一丝珍贵的力气了。\n她有必须要等的人。\n万幸，她已经听到了那人赶来的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"终于，哪怕无力再睁开眼，但她也知道——\n那人回来了——\n凯尔希......\n凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明知道这样的可能性始终存在......为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该留下，是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾......西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我们本可以......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅......确认死......死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，听我命令......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备......应对后续的袭击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士和阿米娅......不能再出事......不能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i18"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅睁开了眼，瞳孔中隐隐现出粉色的菱形。\n特蕾西娅依旧紧闭双眼。\n但凯尔希知道。\n这就是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希......我一直在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅！我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，没事的，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听我说——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你现在看到的，是我寄留于王冠中的意识，借由这个孩子的身体与你告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，告诉我，你是否将那面巴别塔旗帜升上了卡兹戴尔的天空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我将它送回卡兹戴尔了，我看着它升上了高空......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我回来得太晚了，我明知道有这种可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要为此自责，凯尔希，你有自己的任务需要完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且在最后......我还是等到你了，这已经足够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我们，没有更多时间告别了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，凯尔希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请不要责怪自己，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们曾信任过博士，我希望你能在未来继续沿着我们的道路前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，不必再为此而疑虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我杀死了他，也救下了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请将他送回他应在的地方，如果他还能醒来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"指引他，他会带领我们走到我们道路的终点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我深信不疑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......我们不能再冒险进入......罗德岛的深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会拜托一位熟人，将博士送到乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在切尔诺伯格，他会被安置得很好。博士继续留在罗德岛，风险......太高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样很好......凯尔希。那以后的事情，就要交给阿米娅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她会走上一条很难的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会陪着她，巴别塔......会陪着她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很幼小，但足够坚强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，我并非因为临时起意才自私地将王冠留在巴别塔......留给她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要打破循环，应对即将到来的未来......魔王不能只是萨卡兹的魔王，魔王也不能成为泰拉的魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王不是枷锁，不是统御，也不是无可匹敌的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王是钥匙，是......“文明的存续”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要告诉阿米娅，凯尔希，她也不必现在就承担这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"踏上那条道路之后，她会明白，她也需要明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有战胜所有的阻力，才能找到那扇通向大地的门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将会消失在理想之中，而她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她会成为燃尽所有腐朽的火焰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她将要离去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你们会是她所追寻理念的最后挣扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后的努力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刽子手们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要试图放弃，在她的结局既定之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向我证明，那条道路依旧有赢下未来的契机——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向她证明，你们所坚持的和平依旧可以得到回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但遗憾的是，我的同胞们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偿还血债的呼声已经响彻在这片大地——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她的死亡已成定局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们失去了一位魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我失去了唯一的亲人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我不会让一切牺牲毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论你们为了和平，或是为了复仇而聚集于此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会听到你们的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们会看到萨卡兹真正的路在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们浸染维多利亚阶梯的鲜血终有归处——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里，必须成为我们新的开始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"苦难会再次降临——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全泰拉的屈服——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"会自此而起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——将浴火重生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要阻止他，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......现在的巴别塔做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你总是会想出办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米娅”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在我们共同建立的巴别塔，你永远不是一个人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i16_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殿下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅......！殿下......！殿下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i16_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......殿下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，我回来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"过去，我站在这里时，迎接我的总是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但这次......你不在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还能听到我的声音吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不能再等等，殿下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......该死！该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要他们偿还......我向你保证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有参与的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是他......哪怕是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老师......特雷西斯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他必须面对我......我......必须面对他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有的背叛......痛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅殿下......特雷西斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我唯二的......我却......"},{"type":"narration","text":"云层遮住斜阳，阴影笼罩了阿斯卡纶。\n她再无阳光。再无信仰。\n她挣扎过了，她努力过了。\n只有死亡属于风暴之子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g5_furnaceplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......Logos。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我不知道......我们还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先撤退吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先......回巴别塔去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为何......我竟会......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也正奇怪呢，食腐者之王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为我早就习惯了魔王之死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"谁*萨卡兹粗口*负责的通讯频段？！是不是让军事委员会截了，开这种玩笑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信......我......你给我闭嘴！Scout！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"本舰......应该在这个方向！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅......怎么会这么容易就......就......死掉？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"898年冬，魔王死了。\n以勒什死在了卡兹戴尔毁灭之前。\n魂灵熔炉爆炸而扬起的粉尘在卡兹戴尔地区上空飘荡了三天三夜......\n最终它们如黑色的雪花般落下。\n埋葬了侵略者的尸骨。\n也埋葬了那座曾名为“卡兹戴尔”的废墟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔......不复存在了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但卡兹戴尔从未消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我从魔王那里听来的，他说，卡兹戴尔曾毁灭三千余次，但最终都会被重建。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说不定只是以勒什欺骗民众的把戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已经死了，特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可即使那是他在宫殿中庸碌无事时编撰的故事......至少在这些故事里，我还能听到一丝向往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对可能存在的，平稳生活的向往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胜利了之后呢，如今大家又将在这片土地上开始流浪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞们以英雄之名称颂我们，我们却只能还以一片了无生机的废墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们又能做什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“英雄”......这场战争结束的那刻起，“英雄”便已毫无意义......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......从刚才开始，我似乎一直有听到众魂的耳语......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们越发清晰了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道众魂希望引导我去向何处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本将这视作胜利时因兴奋而产生的虚妄......但看来，不止如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"众魂在召唤你我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那走吧，无论何处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"魔王以勒什长眠于此。\n在山峦般堆砌的尸骸之下。\n在更久远的将来，无人会知晓，曾有一位王陨落于此。\n他如此平庸，如此普通。\n萨卡兹从不铭记失败者。\n在这场改变萨卡兹命运的战争中，人们只会记得六个无比耀眼的英雄之名。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得这里......以勒什的车辇崩毁之后，我们在这里宣誓加入这场战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们的起点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个衣匠，一个卫士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你听到了吗，特雷西斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"众魂的声音从我们的脚下传来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是它呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，它这么渺小。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"王冠。\n在死亡的见证之下——\n在众魂的见证之下——\n双子共同举起了王冠。\n王冠同时选择了双子。\n废墟之上，不知是否真实存在的众魂，同时选定了两种希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......由你来戴上这顶冠冕吧，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魔王不过是历史选择沉默时，属于可怜人的一厢情愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我们改变萨卡兹的命运，不需要借助一个既定的外力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但在这个绝望的时代，它会为我们的同胞带回一丝希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我并不适合成为带来希望的那个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的剑会开辟前路。而你来为我们指引方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"战争方才结束，这一次，我们又要肩负它到何时？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在重新找到安身的家园之前，在黑王冠的苦难将我们吞没之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在所有人能安然睡在同一片天空下之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才提到了，“指引方向”，还记得我们以前那次冒险吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你握着剑，背着我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你指引我从灌木中劈出回家的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"容我亲手为你戴冠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会向所有萨卡兹宣誓......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我们永远平等。”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
